Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:29:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v8: keep first arrow head declaration error and check
 PreparseData skip (2ea1b126e2, crbug 571126471)

Main 2ea1b126e2, not merged to 15.6. The 3.0.1 parser series
(CVE-2026-121082) assumed its RecordDeclarationError guard; without it
es6/regress-arrow-cover-grammar-scope and regress-strict-param-error-order
failed on the error text. Also adds release CHECKs in
GetDataForSkippableFunction and Scanner::SeekForward. Applies as is to
15.6.75.66 as patches/v8 (expression-scope.h patch regenerated).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
